  "sentences": [
    {
      "sid": "c4-0000",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "But Markheim did not pause to watch or understand the transformation.",
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0001",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "However, I did find a lemon yoghurt cake in The Golden Book of Patisserie.",
      "bits": "01"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0002",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "It gathered that Adebayo, a secondary school leaver, was allegedly impregnated by one Martins Tewogbade, who lives in the Bariga area of the state.",
      "bits": "11"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0003",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "The Cut-off of AP ICET 2019 will be announced by the authority after the announcement of results.",
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0004",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Want to be notified of new releases in mihailgmihaylov/ghost-on-kubernetes?",
      "bits": "01"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0005",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "The project developed through a variety of community activities focusing on the available natural assets in the area, place-making, and food accessibility.",
      "bits": "01"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0006",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "To make your stay even more enchanting and fruitful, there are plenty of activities that you are able to enjoy within this superb location.",
      "bits": "00"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0007",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Derek was sent-off quarter of an hour before the end of the game at Islecroft Stadium, his second dismissal this season.",
      "bits": "00"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0008",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "I've only heard of a few authors describe this phenomena.",
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0009",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Use our handy STORAGE CALCULATOR to estimate the amount of space to fit your storage needs.",
      "bits": "01"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0010",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Also note that Romney supports ARPA-E, the $400 million program for long-shot energy research.",
      "bits": "0011"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0011",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "SEMA is committed to being a leader in the transportation infrastructure industry in Canada and to that end we want to attract and retain the best people.",
      "bits": "0100"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0012",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "That is because when you worked on crafts and your artistic efforts were promoted as a child, you were improving your visual processing skills.",
      "bits": "10"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0013",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "It contains Kojic acid, a skin lightening agent which also has anti-fungal and anti-bacterial properties, ensuring that your skin remains healthy in the process of lightening.",
      "bits": "00"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0014",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "The Middle School English / Language Arts program nurtures a love of reading and writing, while also giving students a comprehensive foundation in grammar, spelling and vocabulary.",
      "bits": "1011"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0015",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Virgin Voyages has released designs and images of its RockStar Suites.",
      "bits": "0111"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0016",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "This, the default value if the closemenu attribute is not specified, closes up the menu and all parent menus.",
      "bits": "1010"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0017",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Do not forget to write shopping review and rate your satisfaction.",
      "bits": "1101"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0018",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Gabriella is a native New Yorker who defected to Colorado in 1996, where she lives a life of artful bliss.",
      "bits": "1010"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0019",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "After bathing they will seek out a sunny area to dry off.",
      "bits": "1"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0020",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Direct deposit of dividends allows Shareholders to get these distributions quickly and securely.",
      "bits": "10"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0021",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "System.IO.InvalidDataException: Result record has an invalid \"\"status\"\" attribute value.",
      "bits": "01"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0022",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "I've had another week of going out, boring lectures and all that uni related stuff but i'm really looking forward to Friday when i'm going home for the weekend.",
      "bits": "1000"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0023",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "Side effects, drug interactions, and indication should be discussed with your doctor before having this medication administered.",
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "c4-0024",
      "set": "main",
      "text": "And those dogs ain't the four-legged kind but the two-legged hip-hop type \"dog\".",
      "bits": "0111"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-009613",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Arrange onions in the centre of the foil place the ham on top of the onions.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-018183",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "The Cosy Atmosphere Combined With Modern Facilities Contributes To Guests' Full Relaxation.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-010341",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Veronique currently operates within the mental performance team at Cirque du Soleil, where she supports artists to optimise their performance and ensure their wellbeing.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "01"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-001359",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Grid Diary: This iPhone exclusive app helps users write more freely and effective by organising their journals into grids.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "00"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-006424",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Subsequently, SyDesk generates a summarizing report of the SLA fulfilment throughout all monitored applications, which is intended for the management of the Allianz Insurance Company.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "10"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-012688",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "The recipient receives a gift voucher and their name on the Defence Honour board in the school.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-012102",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Having an open centre or skylight window to allow light and air from above to enter your space is the best Vastu for here.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0001"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-009982",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "At the centre of this work is an understanding of the context of slum development in each city and what results and impact civil society (or grantees) wanted to achieve.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-018971",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "We want to inspire and engage our local businesses, schools, community organisations and the Council to reduce their reliance on single-use plastics.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "11"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-007478",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "For simple cable stripping from the smallest single core cables up to heavy armoured cables, we offer Bronneberg cable strippers.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0011"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-011702",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "SJ71 is committed to giving back to neighbourhoods that support its investment and development activities by sharing our planning and development expertise with community organizations.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0001"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-008663",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "So they decided to gather together once more, somewhere in a place with enough shade to harbour them all.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-014173",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "This includes optimisation of roster patterns, national or regional balancing of resources and skills, and daily management of attendance in accordance with the European Working Time Directive.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-005476",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "The next stretch was my favourite, and the best bit for me of the trip so far.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "00"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-012612",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "When pruned, Barberrys display unusual yellow inner stem, root and trunk colour.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-003388",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "We were thrilled to receive accreditation from the Helplines Partnership, recognising the quality of our support, which includes emotional comfort, practical and procedural advice, signposting and advocacy.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "1101"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-006960",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Social and demographic changed have produced diverseness in organisations.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "01"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-019074",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "It will be interesting to see how the chilled version contrasts in flavour and texture.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "1010"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-018124",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Lifting the sink out and posting things through the hole is also a firm favourite.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "01"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-002434",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Due to the recent unrest in neighbouring Haiti and the ongoing unpredictability of the security situation, it is inadvisable to travel across the border to Haiti.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "0"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-014986",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "The project received the support of the Scottish Centre for Island Studies, The University of the West of Scotland and Bute Connections.",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "10"
    },
    {
      "sid": "pool-c4r-006050",
      "set": "spell",
      "text": "Specifically with regard to cycling, will close passes and intimidating behaviour towards cyclists be monitored and how?",
      "has_uk": true,
      "bits": "1100"
